  "comment": "Sources for guides.json. Every endpoint is a free public one, fetched once per run with the tracker User-Agent. Verified 2026-10-15 from a Windows machine; Reddit and the GitHub search API may rate limit CI runners, which shows up per source in guides.json 'sources'. Placeholders {since} = YYYY-MM-DD 90 days ago, {since_ts} = unix seconds 120 days ago. Dropped after the first live pass: r/ClaudeAI and r/MachineLearning answered HTTP 429 (only r/LocalLLaMA is served to the first request); Bluesky searchPosts needs auth (403), so only author feeds are used.",
